  "description": "Base modpack for the Kryeit server",
  "body": "![Banner](https://kryeit.com/images/banner.png)\n\nWelcome to the official page for the Kryeit modpack. This page will contain the needed mods to join the server, with some information alongside.\n\n# Introduction\n\nThis modpack is aimed to be a foundation of your own modpack. You should add QoL mods and optimization mods to make your experience better.\nYou have an example modpack [here](https://modrinth.com/modpack/kryeit-enhanced)\n\n**INFORMATION**\n- This modpack has the needed mods + [REI](https://modrinth.com/mod/rei) and [AppleSkin](https://modrinth.com/mod/appleskin)\n- It's an unconfigured modpack, only contains the mods\n\n**Hotkeys**\n- H: Opens the missions menu\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
